## Layer boundaries (enforced by import-linter)

- `wine_crawler.config` and `wine_crawler.logging` are foundation modules and must not import `wine_crawler.core`, `wine_crawler.sites`, or `wine_crawler.admin`.
- `wine_crawler.core` must not import `wine_crawler.sites`, `wine_crawler.admin`, or `wine_crawler.cli`.
- `wine_crawler.sites` must not import `wine_crawler.admin` or `wine_crawler.cli`.
- `wine_crawler.admin` must not import `wine_crawler.cli`.

When adding new modules, keep imports flowing downward only.

